  "instructions": [
    "Heat the lardons in a pan over medium heat until crispy. Remove the crispy lardons and set aside.",
    "Add the vegetable oil to the pan and cook the chicken breast until browned on both sides.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger to the pan and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the diced chili peppers and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the fish sauce, brown sugar, and lime juice to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Add the coconut milk and stir to combine.",
    "Return the crispy lardons to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Add the peanuts and stir to combine.",
    "Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Serve hot over rice or noodles.",
    "Garnish with additional peanuts and chili peppers if desired."
  ],
